{
 "_doc": "Wilderness set pieces, round 5: Ember Creek Hot Springs, an old timber hot-springs bathhouse resort up a remote valley that the Cordon made a holding site. Route: up the valley road -> the bathhouse's front doors, boarded by the Cordon -> along the boardwalk past the steaming rock pool -> cabin 4 (a guest's letter) -> cabin 3, kicked in, jaws on its step -> the caretaker's cabin (his key ring: taking it, opening cabin 2 or the jaws wake the guests) -> in over the ladies' changing room's broken window -> the lobby (the Cordon's man) -> the men's changing room -> the plunge hall (loose boards round the pool wake the bathers) -> the steam room, taken by the Bloom (a can chime on its door wakes the sitters) -> the pump room's padlock (the key ring) -> down the hatch ladder to the boiler room (Emil and the suite key: taking it wakes the boilermen) and the cistern -> back up -> the lobby stair -> the gallery -> the owner's suite (deadbolt, the suite key; a shotgun on the door; Connie, guardian; the strongbox) -> down -> draw the lobby's side door bolt. Props: props/wild5_springs.json.",
